    "authoring": {
      "intent": "The detained child runs the same salt-short CREATE2 with one byte of initcode at offset 2^256 - 1 and a spendable allowance one below the initcode fee. The fee crosses detention before the offset is checked, so the child returns its unspent gas to the parent. Checking the offset first would halt it (SATIN-SIZE-005, SATIN-DET-018)."
